*.tsbuildinfo
# `pnpm typecheck` runs `tsc -b`, and tsconfig.node.json is a composite project, so it cannot set
# `noEmit` - it drops compiled copies of vite.config.ts (the JS module and its declaration file)
# beside the source.
/vite.config.js
/vite.config.d.ts

